          "id": "summary_text",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "I have outlined rental options for a standard sedan at San Francisco International Airport (SFO) for your trip from December 1 to December 5, 2024. The estimated duration is 4 days. A budget of $300 allows for approximately $75 per day including taxes and fees, which is feasible for standard or intermediate classes depending on current demand.",
